From: Tsuji Riya <tsuji.riya@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 03:14:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 13/28] mtd: rawnand: Add Celestial CNC1800L NAND controller
 driver

Add an exec_op based raw NAND driver for the CNC1800L controller. The
ECC scheme follows the standard NAND properties of the chip node: the
default is the SoC 1-bit Hamming engine in the vendor on-flash format
(3 bytes per 512 bytes), which the generic software Hamming cannot
decode; generic soft ECC (Hamming/BCH) can be selected from the device
tree.

Signed-off-by: Tsuji Riya <tsuji.riya@gmail.com>
---
